1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,877
Bina solve kiye batao —
roots real hain ya nahi?

2
00:00:03,026 --> 00:00:04,591
Poora solve karne ki zaroorat nahi.

3
00:00:04,636 --> 00:00:06,613
Bas ek number nikaalo —
Discriminant.

4
00:00:06,653 --> 00:00:08,990
D equals b square minus 4ac.

5
00:00:09,275 --> 00:00:12,469
Agar D zero se bada hai —
do alag real roots.

6
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:15,063
D barabar zero —
do barabar real roots.

7
00:00:15,149 --> 00:00:17,580
Aur D zero se chhota —
koi real root nahi.

8
00:00:17,718 --> 00:00:21,124
Ab hamara sawaal:
a = 2, b = −4, c = 3.

9
00:00:31,259 --> 00:00:35,470
Minus 4 ka square plus 16 hota hai,
minus 16 nahi.

